        ^"Personality" STRING "Hermes wakes up in the night terrified that he’s going to be kidnapped again.\n\nGoal: Moving past the trauma, and allowing that horribly experience to energize action, rather than paralyze.\n\nBarrier: The feelings of loss are overwhelming. There is unprocessed grief and anger that cannot be accessed because the panic is overwhelming. Hard to appreciate what he does have."
